    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Move and win in &quot;Movement Gods&quot;, a third-person online shooter based on advanced movement mechanics. The action takes place in the distant future, where robots are fighting for glory on the remnants of human civilization!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVANCED MECHANICS</h2>Do you miss dynamic battles? In Movement Gods, you will have to move like the floor is lava! Discover the mechanics to find the best way to survive in this challenging world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/b7eb1d878e8d17f6c46228ff3ec7f484.poster.avif?t=1753712458\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/b7eb1d878e8d17f6c46228ff3ec7f484.webm?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/b7eb1d878e8d17f6c46228ff3ec7f484.mp4?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VARIETY OF WEAPONS</h2>Each weapon has its own characteristics. You can fire a blasting pistol, toss kunai at your enemies, and deflect projectiles with your katana! Choose weapons to suit your style and destroy your opponents!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/b0143fd19dad70be590276ef2ac29ac7.poster.avif?t=1753712458\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/b0143fd19dad70be590276ef2ac29ac7.webm?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/b0143fd19dad70be590276ef2ac29ac7.mp4?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE UNIVERSE</h2>Learn about the future world, in which humans no longer hold a place.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/48d6fc7567673051c8d769b3c48b6dcd.poster.avif?t=1753712458\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/48d6fc7567673051c8d769b3c48b6dcd.webm?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/48d6fc7567673051c8d769b3c48b6dcd.mp4?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKILL-BASED PVP</h2>Use mechanics and a variety of weapons to snatch victory from the hands of your opponents!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/24dac10f03105eb18b3ccb04fb607681.poster.avif?t=1753712458\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/24dac10f03105eb18b3ccb04fb607681.webm?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/24dac10f03105eb18b3ccb04fb607681.mp4?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR CHARACTER</h2>Participate in battles and get paid. Buy skills and weapons to become stronger!",
    "about_the_game": "Move and win in &quot;Movement Gods&quot;, a third-person online shooter based on advanced movement mechanics. The action takes place in the distant future, where robots are fighting for glory on the remnants of human civilization!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVANCED MECHANICS</h2>Do you miss dynamic battles? In Movement Gods, you will have to move like the floor is lava! Discover the mechanics to find the best way to survive in this challenging world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/b7eb1d878e8d17f6c46228ff3ec7f484.poster.avif?t=1753712458\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/b7eb1d878e8d17f6c46228ff3ec7f484.webm?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/b7eb1d878e8d17f6c46228ff3ec7f484.mp4?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VARIETY OF WEAPONS</h2>Each weapon has its own characteristics. You can fire a blasting pistol, toss kunai at your enemies, and deflect projectiles with your katana! Choose weapons to suit your style and destroy your opponents!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/b0143fd19dad70be590276ef2ac29ac7.poster.avif?t=1753712458\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/b0143fd19dad70be590276ef2ac29ac7.webm?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/b0143fd19dad70be590276ef2ac29ac7.mp4?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE UNIVERSE</h2>Learn about the future world, in which humans no longer hold a place.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/48d6fc7567673051c8d769b3c48b6dcd.poster.avif?t=1753712458\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/48d6fc7567673051c8d769b3c48b6dcd.webm?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/48d6fc7567673051c8d769b3c48b6dcd.mp4?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKILL-BASED PVP</h2>Use mechanics and a variety of weapons to snatch victory from the hands of your opponents!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/24dac10f03105eb18b3ccb04fb607681.poster.avif?t=1753712458\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/24dac10f03105eb18b3ccb04fb607681.webm?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708930/extras/24dac10f03105eb18b3ccb04fb607681.mp4?t=1753712458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR CHARACTER</h2>Participate in battles and get paid. Buy skills and weapons to become stronger!",
